# The original asset folders live at the repo root on the owner's machine.
# Everything the build reads has been copied into /public, so these are source
# material rather than build input and the repo does not need them.
#
# This was a comment with no patterns under it until now, which meant 4.3MB of
# originals would have been committed on the first push. They are excluded
# deliberately, so they are NOT backed up by this repository. Keep your own
# copy of them.
